# 2026-10-28 (owner: "We hit the deployment storage cap"): deploy only what the live page loads. Every deploy used to upload the whole
# repo (~706 MB: docs/ screenshots and balance runs alone are 461 MB); the page is one inlined index.html plus these folders (~87 MB).
# Checked: a copy of exactly these paths loads Home, Conquest, Deck, Codex and Shop with no failed requests.
/*
!/index.html
!/assets
!/fonts
!/art
!/version.json
!/robots.txt
!/vercel.json
!/CREDITS.md
!/licenses
# 2026-10-18: the desktop app's source (fonts, icons, Electron code) is never loaded by the website
electron/
